cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Media Attention Ontology (MAO)"
message: "If you use this ontology or its findings, please cite it."
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: Fabio
    family-names: Rovai
    affiliation: "Kampakis and Co Ltd, trading as The Tesseract Academy"
repository-code: "https://github.com/fabio-rovai/media-attention-ontology"
abstract: >-
  An open OWL 2 ontology, SKOS registries and SHACL governance layer for content
  identity, distribution and measured attention across screens, validated against
  224,710 EIDR identifier assertions harvested from Wikidata and resolved against
  EIDR's public registry, and including the first SKOS serialisation of the IAB
  Tech Lab Content, Audience and Ad Product taxonomies.
license: CC-BY-4.0
date-released: "2026-08-16"
version: "0.1.0"
